- [ ] T028 [P] [US2] 策略测试 `internal/app/policy_refresh_test.go`：`TestPolicyRefresh_DigestMatchesApplied`、`TestPolicyRefresh_DigestDetectsDelete`、`TestPolicyRefresh_SameContentNewRevision`、`TestPolicyRefresh_ConcurrentNoRegression`、`TestPolicyRefresh_LongIdleStaysFresh`（连续十个刷新周期不误判过期）、`TestPolicyRefresh_StaleRejectsRun`。
- [ ] T029 [P] [US2] 技能联动与修复测试 `internal/app/skill_repair_test.go`、`internal/app/rebuild_bundle_skill_test.go`：`TestSkillPublish_RepublishesDependents`、`TestSkillPublish_DoesNotPublishWorkCopy`、`TestSkillRepublish_OutOfOrderPublishKeepsNewest`、`TestSkillRepair_RecoversWithoutRestart`、`TestSkillRepair_BlockedAfterRepeatedFailures`、`TestSkillRepair_WorkerDoesNotRepublish`；从已安装目录重建、不读工作副本、ConfigHash 沿用。
